### Auth endpoints
@host = http://localhost:6969

### Register a new user (role: HOLDER by default)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "holder@test.edu",
  "password": "TestPass-123!",
  "fullName": "Test Holder"
}

### Login (sets refresh_token cookie, captures accessToken)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "holder@test.edu",
  "password": "TestPass-123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("authToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Refresh access token (uses refresh_token cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh

### Logout (revokes refresh token, clears cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout